    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/045eac0783bab32be09167f22870852f.avif?t=1752499839\" width=616 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebel Core: Awakens</strong> is a fast paced action platformer inspired by classic jump-n-shoot games of the 16-bit era. Face off against the 8 Core Robotics in each of their own unique domains in any order you choose as you fight to rebalance a world overtaken by machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c0cb431749b2943aa2173b129c6d0b56.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c0cb431749b2943aa2173b129c6d0b56.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3-way &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; combat mechanic brings fast paced, moment-to-moment decision making as you engage each enemy with the ideal attack (or defense!) balance between Ranged Attacks, Melee Attacks, and Shield Defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c90e5491c92c5ff0571889de41454976.poster.webp?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c90e5491c92c5ff0571889de41454976.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive platforming and shooting gameplay reminiscent of the 16-bit era comes to life in a modern, fully-3d side-scrolling display ripe with wall climbing, platform hopping, chasm crossing, and lengthy pursuits both horizontal and vertical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/3959e853571546604ae049774a1cfc0b.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/3959e853571546604ae049774a1cfc0b.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work to defeat each of the 8 <i>Core Robotics</i> that rule over their own slice of the post-humanity world in any order to gain access to <strong>The Citadel</strong>, home of the <i>The Council</i>, the five Origin Cores that rule over all robot-kind. But is the Citadel their true resting place? Or are there challenging lands that lie beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/bb4a714209b4787d173614b8fa2e2950.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/bb4a714209b4787d173614b8fa2e2950.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with which levels and bosses you'll beat first as defeating one may have a ripple effect that can change anything from minor to major elements of other levels.\u00a0Different bosses that have been defeated will have an impact on other levels in the game - from cosmetic and story changes to significant and structural ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/ae8f8ba516e9f77c62379bf605296d97.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/ae8f8ba516e9f77c62379bf605296d97.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful upgrades and abilities hidden throughout the levels and from defeating bosses, discover their strengths and weaknesses, and wield them to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/d56dde475b2def0d1153e665f25102d6.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/d56dde475b2def0d1153e665f25102d6.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is a classic platformer without a killer sound track? An homage to the 16 and 32-bit era, this synth metal OST trades midi for electric guitars and synthesizers, matching the action in a synthesis of retro and modern video game music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/9c9ed3a0e138758573677046b9bceec7.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/9c9ed3a0e138758573677046b9bceec7.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world conquered by machines a lonely hero wakes to find themself in a long-abandoned, makeshift laboratory. The sole machine to rebel against <i>the anti-human directive</i> has spent years hidden away, quietly completing the final subroutines that have restored it to operational status.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaving behind the once crowded base of the human resistance, the <i>Rebel Core</i> steps out into a scorching wasteland, unsure of what will come ahead in the dangerous search for answers, atonement, and <strong>retribution</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/045eac0783bab32be09167f22870852f.avif?t=1752499839\" width=616 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebel Core: Awakens</strong> is a fast paced action platformer inspired by classic jump-n-shoot games of the 16-bit era. Face off against the 8 Core Robotics in each of their own unique domains in any order you choose as you fight to rebalance a world overtaken by machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c0cb431749b2943aa2173b129c6d0b56.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c0cb431749b2943aa2173b129c6d0b56.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3-way &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; combat mechanic brings fast paced, moment-to-moment decision making as you engage each enemy with the ideal attack (or defense!) balance between Ranged Attacks, Melee Attacks, and Shield Defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c90e5491c92c5ff0571889de41454976.poster.webp?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/c90e5491c92c5ff0571889de41454976.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive platforming and shooting gameplay reminiscent of the 16-bit era comes to life in a modern, fully-3d side-scrolling display ripe with wall climbing, platform hopping, chasm crossing, and lengthy pursuits both horizontal and vertical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/3959e853571546604ae049774a1cfc0b.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/3959e853571546604ae049774a1cfc0b.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work to defeat each of the 8 <i>Core Robotics</i> that rule over their own slice of the post-humanity world in any order to gain access to <strong>The Citadel</strong>, home of the <i>The Council</i>, the five Origin Cores that rule over all robot-kind. But is the Citadel their true resting place? Or are there challenging lands that lie beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/bb4a714209b4787d173614b8fa2e2950.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/bb4a714209b4787d173614b8fa2e2950.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with which levels and bosses you'll beat first as defeating one may have a ripple effect that can change anything from minor to major elements of other levels.\u00a0Different bosses that have been defeated will have an impact on other levels in the game - from cosmetic and story changes to significant and structural ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/ae8f8ba516e9f77c62379bf605296d97.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/ae8f8ba516e9f77c62379bf605296d97.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful upgrades and abilities hidden throughout the levels and from defeating bosses, discover their strengths and weaknesses, and wield them to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/d56dde475b2def0d1153e665f25102d6.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/d56dde475b2def0d1153e665f25102d6.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is a classic platformer without a killer sound track? An homage to the 16 and 32-bit era, this synth metal OST trades midi for electric guitars and synthesizers, matching the action in a synthesis of retro and modern video game music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/9c9ed3a0e138758573677046b9bceec7.poster.avif?t=1752499839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763120/extras/9c9ed3a0e138758573677046b9bceec7.webp?t=1752499839\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=209 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world conquered by machines a lonely hero wakes to find themself in a long-abandoned, makeshift laboratory. The sole machine to rebel against <i>the anti-human directive</i> has spent years hidden away, quietly completing the final subroutines that have restored it to operational status.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaving behind the once crowded base of the human resistance, the <i>Rebel Core</i> steps out into a scorching wasteland, unsure of what will come ahead in the dangerous search for answers, atonement, and <strong>retribution</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
